    mc "N-no, stiamo bene."

# game/ch10eng.rpy:9479
translate italian ch10_378asdcont_dfc26f5f:

    # d "What I didn’t want was for you two to go out partying, that’s all."
    d "Quello che non volevo era che voi due usciste a far festa, tutto qui."

# game/ch10eng.rpy:9480
translate italian ch10_378asdcont_fb9c3c92:

    # mc "She hangs out with [mia] more now, that’s why we don’t talk much anymore."
    mc "Ora esce di più con [mia], ecco perché non parliamo più molto."

# game/ch10eng.rpy:9481
translate italian ch10_378asdcont_0bd970be:

    # a "If that’s the case, then alright."
    a "Se è così, allora va bene."

# game/ch10eng.rpy:9482
translate italian ch10_378asdcont_5fa0c7c3:

    # a "I just worry that you’re always at home, and now that you’re working, you should go unwind a bit with the girls at least, [mc]."
